message:
Fix zones without fill (#799)

This appears to fix unfilled zones

@napowderly can you confirm the zone causing trouble was unfilled?

Add hide designators to the build CLI (#1179)

@jrhrsmit made this nice feature, but it was not accessible at the build
process

Libs: Picker: Move endpoint specification into modules (#1429)

Modules specify API endpoint and expected parameters. Picker no longer
needs knowledge of specific modules.

Usage:
```python
@L.rt_field
def pickable(self):
    return F.is_pickable_by_type(
        endpoint=F.is_pickable_by_type.Endpoint.RESISTORS,
        params=[self.resistance, self.max_power, self.max_voltage],
    )
```
